        "id": 2614525,
        "name": "Deadly Dark Railway",
        "username": "Deadly_Dark_Railway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/deadly_dark_railway/{size}/438379_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-26T13:49:47.391Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello Eve developers,</p>\n<p>Why is there still no option to up scale the cursor?<br>\nOn a 4K 55inch Monitor it looks like a dot so small and many times i just loose track on were the cursor is.<br>\nFonts can be upscaled, any idea to implent this option for the cursor also?<br>\nOn google i read many complains about this and request to Eve Developers to give us the option to make your cursor size a lot bigger. 3th party software doesnt work the bypass or fix this issue.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 9,
        "updated_at": "2024-10-26T13:50:46.364Z",
