        "created_at": "2024-10-27T06:14:04.415Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I dont know what it means that it is wrapped up in hardcode but if you can change font size and scalling screenplay up nd down you can als implement the option to change cursor size. Even CCP must undertsand that is a must have if you playing eve on a 4K monitor. Software ingeneers can fix this easly to add the code for this option. We have almost everyday a patch update to add,remove or fix something in the game.</p>",
