        "created_at": "2024-10-27T07:48:25.034Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of course, but I did write ‘hard’ to accept rather than ‘impossible’ to do so!</p>\n<p>I wonder whether they’ll ever do a rewrite? Perhaps it’s not a good idea; we might lose a heck of a lot more than a miniscule pointer!</p>",
