      {
        "id": 2614926,
        "name": "Max Deveron",
        "username": "Max_Deveron",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/max_deveron/{size}/245870_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-27T08:19:00.791Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hard Code in EvE…</p>\n<p>A Dev once stated, imagine the code of EvE, the old undocumented stuff…</p>\n<p>As a huge ball of wet spaghetti noodles… pull one in the center mass the wrong way…it breaks…and breaks everything else attached directly to it…</p>\n<p>Might i mention PoS Code…and why we still can use them despite Upwells existing.</p>",
